<div class="py-8 sm:py-14 bg-brand-cream" data-section-id="{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8">
    <!-- Breadcrumbs -->
    {% render 'breadcrumbs' %}

    <div class="text-center space-y-3">
      <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs uppercase tracking-ultra text-brand-gold font-semibold">
        ATELIER PROTOCOLS &amp; HERITAGE CHARTER
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-light text-brand-espresso uppercase tracking-tight">
        {{ page.title | default: 'Information & Policies' }}
      </h1>
    </div>

    <!-- Page Content if populated in Shopify Admin -->
    {%- if page.content != blank -%}
      <div class="bg-[#FCFBF9] border border-[#EDE4D8] p-6 sm:p-10 rounded-sm shadow-sm text-xs text-brand-mutedGray font-light leading-relaxed prose prose-sm max-w-none">
        {{ page.content }}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    <!-- Haute Couture Policy Pillars -->
    <div class="space-y-4 text-xs">
      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <details class="bg-[#FCFBF9] border border-[#EDE4D8] rounded-sm p-6 group shadow-sm" open>
        <summary class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold text-brand-espresso list-none">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-gold">01.</span> Complimentary White Glove Delivery</span>
          <span class="text-brand-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-180">▾</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="pt-4 text-brand-mutedGray font-light leading-relaxed space-y-2 border-t border-[#EDE4D8] mt-4">
          <p>Char Chaand provides insured, complimentary white-glove delivery across all major Indian metropolitan centres and tier-one cities. Every piece is transported in temperature-controlled transit packaging.</p>
          <p>International shipments to over 45 countries are dispatched via DHL Express Diplomatic Transit with real-time consignment tracking.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <details class="bg-[#FCFBF9] border border-[#EDE4D8] rounded-sm p-6 group shadow-sm">
        <summary class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold text-brand-espresso list-none">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-gold">02.</span> Bespoke Fitting &amp; Sizing Protocols</span>
          <span class="text-brand-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-180">▾</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="pt-4 text-brand-mutedGray font-light leading-relaxed space-y-2 border-t border-[#EDE4D8] mt-4">
          <p>Upon consignment sanction, an atelier liaison coordinates with you for precise 32-point anatomical measurements. We provide complimentary post-delivery minor alteration passes within 30 days of receipt.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <details class="bg-[#FCFBF9] border border-[#EDE4D8] rounded-sm p-6 group shadow-sm">
        <summary class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold text-brand-espresso list-none">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-gold">03.</span> Heirloom Preservation &amp; Storage</span>
          <span class="text-brand-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-180">▾</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="pt-4 text-brand-mutedGray font-light leading-relaxed space-y-2 border-t border-[#EDE4D8] mt-4">
          <p>Every bridal and sherwani creation arrives in an archival unbleached muslin garment bag inside a bespoke velvet-lined wooden chest. Store away from direct sunlight in a dry, ventilated setting.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <details class="bg-[#FCFBF9] border border-[#EDE4D8] rounded-sm p-6 group shadow-sm">
        <summary class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold text-brand-espresso list-none">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-gold">04.</span> Cancellation &amp; Returns Policy</span>
          <span class="text-brand-gold transition-transform group-open:rotate-180">▾</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="pt-4 text-brand-mutedGray font-light leading-relaxed space-y-2 border-t border-[#EDE4D8] mt-4">
          <p>Due to the bespoke, individually commissioned nature of our haute couture creations, customized orders cannot be cancelled once fabric cutting and embroidery formulate (48 hours after order placement).</p>
          <p>Pret and archival jewellery pieces may be exchanged within 7 days of delivery, subject to tag preservation and inspection.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>

    <!-- Concierge Help Footer -->
    <div class="p-6 bg-brand-champagne/60 border border-[#EDE4D8] rounded-sm text-xs text-center space-y-2">
      <p class="font-semibold text-brand-espresso uppercase tracking-wider">Have Additional Inquiries or Require Legal Documentation?</p>
      <a href="/pages/contact" class="inline-block text-brand-burgundy font-semibold underline uppercase tracking-widest text-[10px]">
        Contact Atelier Legal &amp; Concierge Desk →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Page Content",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
